      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "下列敘述何者正確？"
        },
        {
          "type": "options",
          "items": [
            "數列 $3,6,9,12,15$ 是一個公差為 $3$ 的等差數列。",
            "數列 $4,4,4,4,4,4$ 不是一個等差數列。",
            "$9$ 是 $4$ 與 $25$ 的等差中項。",
            "$2+4+8+16+32=\\dfrac{5\\times(2+32)}2$。"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "sourceNumber": "2",
      "page": 1,
      "difficulty": "medium",
      "primaryUnitId": "nanyi-8-2-1-2",
      "unitIds": [
        "nanyi-8-2-1-2"
      ],
      "unitAssignmentBasis": "依題目主要概念歸屬。",
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "判斷下面哪一個是等差級數？"
        },
        {
          "type": "options",
          "items": [
            "$1,2,3,4,5,6$",
            "$2+4+6+8+12+14$",
            "$\\dfrac11+\\dfrac12+\\dfrac13+\\dfrac14+\\dfrac15+\\dfrac16$",
            "$1+3+5+7+9+11$"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "sourceNumber": "3",
      "page": 1,
      "difficulty": "medium",
      "primaryUnitId": "nanyi-8-2-4-3",
      "unitIds": [
        "nanyi-8-2-4-3"
      ],
      "unitAssignmentBasis": "依題目主要概念歸屬。",
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "下列敘述何者正確？"
        },
        {
          "type": "options",
          "items": [
            "正方形的對稱軸恰有 $4$ 條。",
            "四個角都是直角的四邊形必為正方形。",
            "如果 $\\angle A+\\angle B=90^\\circ$，就稱 $\\angle A$ 與 $\\angle B$ 這兩個角互補。",
            "平行四邊形、菱形、等腰三角形都是線對稱圖形。"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "sourceNumber": "4",
      "page": 1,
      "difficulty": "medium",
      "primaryUnitId": "nanyi-8-2-1-1",
      "unitIds": [
        "nanyi-8-2-1-1"
      ],
      "unitAssignmentBasis": "依題目主要概念歸屬。",
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "數列 $a,b,c$ 為等差數列，公差為 $3$，則關於數列 $a+5,b+10,c+15$ 的敘述，下列何者正確？"
        },
        {
          "type": "options",
          "items": [
            "是公差為 $3$ 的等差數列",
            "是公差為 $5$ 的等差數列",
            "是公差為 $8$ 的等差數列",
            "不是等差數列"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "sourceNumber": "5",
      "page": 1,
      "difficulty": "medium",
      "primaryUnitId": "nanyi-8-2-4-3",
      "unitIds": [
        "nanyi-8-2-4-3"
      ],
      "unitAssignmentBasis": "依題目主要概念歸屬。",
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "正方形、長方形、菱形、箏形、平行四邊形及梯形，上述四邊形當中，線對稱圖形有幾個？"
        },
        {
          "type": "options",
          "items": [
            "$6$",
            "$5$",
            "$4$",
            "$3$"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "sourceNumber": "6",
      "page": 1,
      "difficulty": "medium",
      "primaryUnitId": "nanyi-8-2-4-3",
      "unitIds": [
        "nanyi-8-2-4-3"
      ],
      "unitAssignmentBasis": "依題目主要概念歸屬。",
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "如圖，四邊形 $ABCD$ 是線對稱圖形，直線 $AC$ 為其對稱軸，$B,D$ 為對稱點，則下列敘述何者不一定正確？"
        },
        {
          "type": "svg",
          "maxHeight": 95,
          "svg": "<svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 260 150\"><g fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#111\" stroke-width=\"1.4\"><path d=\"M20 75 L125 20 L230 75 L125 130 Z M125 20 L125 130\"/><path d=\"M20 75 L230 75\" stroke-dasharray=\"4 3\"/></g><g fill=\"#111\" font-size=\"14\"><text x=\"5\" y=\"80\">A</text><text x=\"121\" y=\"146\">B</text><text x=\"234\" y=\"80\">C</text><text x=\"121\" y=\"16\">D</text></g></svg>"
        },
        {
          "type": "options",
          "items": [
            "$\\overline{AC}$ 與 $\\overline{BD}$ 互相垂直",
            "$\\overline{AC}$ 與 $\\overline{BD}$ 互相平分",
            "$\\angle ADC=\\angle ABC$",
            "$\\overline{CD}=\\overline{CB}$"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "sourceNumber": "7",
      "page": 1,
      "difficulty": "medium",
      "primaryUnitId": "nanyi-8-2-3-1",
      "unitIds": [
        "nanyi-8-2-3-1"
      ],
      "unitAssignmentBasis": "依題目主要概念歸屬。",
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "下列關於角的性質的敘述，何者正確？"
        },
        {
          "type": "options",
          "items": [
            "$\\angle A$ 和 $\\angle B$ 互補，則 $\\angle A+\\angle B=90^\\circ$",
            "若 $\\angle B$ 等於 $\\angle A$，則 $\\angle A$ 和 $\\angle B$ 為對頂角",
            "兩直線相交最多會形成六個銳角",
            "直角的對頂角是 $90^\\circ$"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "sourceNumber": "8",
      "page": 1,
      "difficulty": "medium",
      "primaryUnitId": "nanyi-8-2-1-2",
      "unitIds": [
