    },
    {
      "type": "fill",
      "sourceNumber": "2",
      "page": 2,
      "difficulty": "medium",
      "primaryUnitId": "nanyi-8-2-3-1",
      "unitIds": [
        "nanyi-8-2-3-1"
      ],
      "unitAssignmentBasis": "依題目主要概念歸屬。",
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "如圖，兩直線交於一點，所形成的四個角依次為 $\\angle1,\\angle2,\\angle3,\\angle4$，若 $\\angle1=(2x+100)^\\circ$，$\\angle3=(4x+40)^\\circ$，則 $\\angle4$ 為＿＿＿＿度。"
        },
        {
          "type": "svg",
          "maxHeight": 95,
          "svg": "<svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 260 150\"><g fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#111\" stroke-width=\"1.4\"><path d=\"M20 110 L230 35 M15 90 L235 70\"/></g><g fill=\"#111\" font-size=\"14\"><text x=\"126\" y=\"64\">1</text><text x=\"72\" y=\"100\">2</text><text x=\"130\" y=\"100\">3</text><text x=\"160\" y=\"72\">4</text></g></svg>"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "fill",
      "sourceNumber": "3",
      "page": 2,
      "difficulty": "medium",
      "primaryUnitId": "nanyi-8-2-1-1",
      "unitIds": [
